RUN 3 -- DLF from eth3 (master) and eth2 (via sa3 -> members 1/4) AT ONCE
  window 11:35:04-11:35:14   sent eth3 800,001 @ 957.4 Mbps   eth2 822,001 @ 983.6 Mbps
  rx eth1 <- eth2  387,019   rx eth1 <- eth3  436,247   (sum 823,266 = eth1's 1G egress
                                                          saturated by two 1G floods; the
                                                          drop is egress congestion, ~47/53)
  rx eth2 <- eth3  800,001 (100%)      rx eth3 <- eth2  822,001 (100%)
  CPU rx per member after run 3: {1: 1,274, 3: 1,540, 4: 1,357}.
  Console during the run (`terminal monitor`): one line, "dhclient: XMT: Solicit on vlan1".

AFTER (23:37 UTC): `show log | include corosync` and `| include flow control` list only
